            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The prognostic value of some coronary risk factors related to Stress/Echocardiography was analyzed. The most important prognostic factors during an abnormal study are: presence and time of beginning, severity and extension of the myocardial ischemic changes.</AbstractText>
